WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.900
It feels like the world is moving at a
faster rate than ever.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.140
Every day, smartphones are getting smarter,

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.400
A.I. is becoming more inteligent

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.683
and our environment seems to be
getting worse every year.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:21.554
If you were to travel 50 years into the the future,
what would the world look like?

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:33.566
This is WHAT IF, and here's what would happen
if you lived 50 years into the future.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.935
Look down at your and phone think

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:35.969
Look down at your and phone think
how far technology has
come in the last 10 years.

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:38.038
how far technology has
come in the last 10 years.

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:42.542
Have you ever imagined
what tech might look like in 50 years?

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.310
What about your family and friends?

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.545
What'll happen to them?

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.281
In 50 years time we may actually look back

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.383
and laugh at how we had to hold our phones.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.351
How primative!

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.287
Instead, our smartphones will either be worn,

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.956
or implanted in us through contact lenses.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.427
Imagine being able to have your
GPS embedded in your vision,

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:02.762
instead of having to look down at your phone.

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:06.566
But, although this all sounds nice,
there will be problems too.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.902
If you don't want to fast-forward
yourself into the future

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.271
because you're worried that your
family might not be around,

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:14.074
Well you can rest easy, knowing
that in 50 years,

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:18.044
the average life expectancy will be
about 80 - 90 years.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.647
That's over 10 years longer than what it is today.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:25.385
Since the 1960s our population percentages
have always looked like a pyramid.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:29.556
But 50 years into the future that
pyramid will look like a rectangle.

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.659
This means that there will be an equal
percentage of senior citizens

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:34.194
to toddlers.

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:36.663
This, will have a huge effect on the economy.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:38.865
Grandma and Grandpa will be
retiring much later,

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:42.735
and when they do, those seniors'
homes are going to be packed.

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:45.972
With more people in the work force,
jobs will be harder to find.

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:47.474
Just graduated school?

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.609
Expect to live at home with
mom and dad a bit longer.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:57.050
Especially since AI is expected to be working
over 800 million of our former jobs by 2030.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.887
The world's population will
be at an all time high.

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:05.191
By this time, the Earth's population
will have reached a staggering 9 billion people.

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.527
More people means more problems.

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:10.430
There will be a much higher
probability of food shortages

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.632
as we try to grow crops to feed everyone.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:16.302
Crops will be harder to grow as well,
with increasing temperatures.

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:19.939
And with 70% of the world's
population living in cities,

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:24.210
crowding will lead to more
diseases being spread, and faster.

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:27.280
As for the environment, well that
doesn't look too good either.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:31.684
The Amazon rainforest will continue
to be deforested and in 50 years time,

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:35.021
half of it will be gone. 
Don't expect it to come back either

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:38.625
increasing climate change will
render it a parched shrubland.

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:44.597
Higher temperatures will cause polar ice
caps to less than 50% of what they are today.

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:49.402
And the Dead Sea may actually live up to its
name, as its water will continue to evaporate.

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.771
Thinking about visiting American cities

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:52.739
like New Orleans,

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:53.740
Miami,

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:54.741
and Houston?

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:56.509
Sorry, but you're out of luck.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.012
Hurricanes will get a lot worse
in the next 50 years,

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:02.549
as well as higher water levels leading
to us abandoning the Gulf Coast.

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:04.851
But don't worry, it isn't all bad!

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:08.454
Although the world may be dying, it's not
the only place humans will have to live.

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:11.891
In the next 50 years, humans will
have begun colonizing Mars.

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:16.429
Private companies will even be attempting
to travel to the Alpha Centauri system,

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:19.199
the closest star system to our Solar System.

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:22.669
While there we'll visit the
Proxima-centauri B planet

00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:24.737
which has a good chance of housing alien life.

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:28.341
If we don't find any little green men, we
might decide to colonize it ourselves.

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:32.879
So, we've talked about the human race,
and the environment, but what about you?

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.915
What's going to happen with
you 50 years into the future?

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:39.452
Well first off, you won't have to go
to the doctor for your annual checkup.

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:42.989
You'll have a device where you can
scan yourself for any diseases.

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:46.125
Watch for body modifications
to rise in popularity.

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:48.294
And we're not talking
about tattoos or piercings.

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:52.498
You'll be able to get things like cybernetic
eyes that will allow you to see better,

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:55.735
and to see things that are
invisible to us today like radiation.

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:58.504
If you're rich from your Bitcoin
investment blowing up,

00:03:58.504 --> 00:03:59.772
then you can even get yourself

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:01.441
a designer baby.

00:04:01.674 --> 00:04:04.978
These babies can be completely
customized from simply what they look like;

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:07.547
to things like their behaviour
and intelligence.

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:09.849
A.I. will be as smart as humans.

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:11.918
They won't have taken over the world just yet,

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:13.386
but they'll be well on their way.

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:16.356
A.I. will constantly be
progressing in intellgence,

00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:19.392
soon being smarter than humans
could ever imagine ourselves.

00:04:19.959 --> 00:04:24.097
Expect them to be working with us, while
humans have more advanced roles in our jobs.

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:27.700
So, are you ready for all the good
and bad that comes with the future?

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:29.469
If not, that's okay!

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:33.273
Just live in the present, and slowly
grow into it over the next 50 years.

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:38.311
Who knows, in the future we may not
even talk about hypothetical scenarios anymore.

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:39.545
Will there be any "What Ifs"

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:43.750
or will every idea in the universe have
gone through a computer simulation?

00:04:44.517 --> 00:04:47.754
That sounds like a question for
another What IF.

